  <data name="联控系统判断参考压力小于加载压力时，会启用停机的机器，直到参考压力达到预期。" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>When the joint control system determines that the reference pressure is less than the loading pressure, it will activate the shut - down machines until the reference pressure reaches the expected value.</value>
  </data>
