    <value>When the joint control system determines that the reference pressure is greater than the unloading pressure, it will stop the running machines until the reference pressure reaches the expected value.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="机器停机后需要等待超过“停机延时[”时间才会允许联控系统再次启动机器。" xml:space="preserve">
