  <data name="设备1的功率，为0不启用设备1的功率调度。功率调度主要作用于变频机器，可以在满足用气压力的情况下，尽可能的少运行机器。例如两台50kw的变频机器，如果输出功率都在10kw时就已经达到用气压力，那么联控系统将会停止其中一台，使另一台达到20kw的输出功率。" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The power of Device 1. If it is set to 0, the power scheduling of Device 1 will not be enabled. Power scheduling is mainly applicable to variable - frequency machines. It can minimize the number of running machines while meeting the gas - using pressure requirements. For example, if there are two 50 - kw variable - frequency machines and the gas - using pressure can be met when their output powers are both 10 kw, the joint control system will stop one of them and make the other reach an output power of 20 kw.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="设备2的功率，为0不启用设备2的功率调度。功率调度主要作用于变频机器，可以在满足用气压力的情况下，尽可能的少运行机器。例如两台50kw的变频机器，如果输出功率都在10kw时就已经达到用气压力，那么联控系统将会停止其中一台，使另一台达到20kw的输出功率。" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The power of Device 2. If it is set to 0, the power scheduling of Device 2 will not be enabled. Power scheduling is mainly applicable to variable - frequency machines. It can minimize the number of running machines while meeting the gas - using pressure requirements. For example, if there are two 50 - kw variable - frequency machines and the gas - using pressure can be met when their output powers are both 10 kw, the joint control system will stop one of them and make the other reach an output power of 20 kw.</value>
