  <data name="用于判断参考压力的最近历史记录是否稳定。如果参考压力的最近历史记录偏移程度小于“稳定方差”，则表示用气稳定，将启动功率调度。" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>It is used to determine whether the recent historical records of the reference pressure are stable. If the deviation degree of the recent historical records of the reference pressure is less than the "stability variance", it indicates that the gas consumption is stable, and power scheduling will be initiated.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="用于进行功率调度的最近历史记录数量。值越大越精准，但相对的功率所需调控时间越长。" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The number of recent historical records used for power scheduling. The larger the value, the more accurate the scheduling will be, but the longer the time required for power adjustment will be.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="实际所需输出功率=“输出功率”乘以“运行功率倍数”。值大些，可以防止“总实际所需输出功率”超过“总设备的功率”，值太小将无法进行功率调度。" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The actual required output power = "Output power" multiplied by "Operating power multiple". A larger value can prevent the "Total actual required output power" from exceeding the "Total power of all devices". If the value is too small, power scheduling cannot be carried out.</value>
